<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         Icon set — Lucide v0.460 (ISC licence), one pack for the whole app:
         shell navigation, workspace tabs, sub-tabs, row actions, status marks,
         the «خلاصهٔ امروز» tiles and the species (animal) marks.

         Rules this file keeps:
         • One source only, so a tick, a cross, a back chevron and a trend arrow
           all share the same 24×24 grid, 2px weight and round terminals.
         • Data is authored on a 24×24 viewBox, and every geometry is pinned to
           that box, so a consumer sizes it with one Width/Height pair and
           <Path Classes="icon" Data="{StaticResource IconX}"/>. The "icon" style
           (Resources/Controls/IconStyle.axaml) supplies the stroke, the round
           terminals and the default 20px box.
         • Glyphs are direction-neutral. The icon style renders them LTR, so the
           RTL page root never mirrors a tick or an arrow.
         • Keys are semantic and stable (IconCart, not IconShoppingCart); they are
           also resolved by name from ViewModels through IconKeyConverter.
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->


